{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/971220/extras/a124cbd454b7e9a79117622a75382184.poster.avif?t=1770243734\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/971220/extras/a124cbd454b7e9a79117622a75382184.webm?t=1770243734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/971220/extras/a124cbd454b7e9a79117622a75382184.mp4?t=1770243734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Rogue Monster Rush!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an ever-evolving journey to defend your island base from hordes of invading robots in this challenging <strong>roguelike x tower defense x monster collecting</strong> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monstrous Tower Defense:</strong>\u00a0Hatch, Upgrade, Collect and command a variety of monster defenders, each with unique abilities, to fend off waves of relentless enemies. Assemble your ultimate party loadout and unleash havoc upon the invading forces. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Roguelike Gameplay:</strong> Every playthrough is a new adventure! Build your maps with randomly chosen tiles, discover powerful upgrades, and adapt your tactics to overcome increasingly challenging waves of foes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Depth:</strong> Master the art of monster placement, resource management, team composition, player abilities, leader skills, and upgrades to outsmart and overpower your adversaries.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active Gameplay:</strong> Engage in a dynamic and active playstyle where every moment counts. Unleash player abilities for clutch moments and enjoy more interactive and thrilling gameplay experiences than traditional tower defense. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incredible Soundtrack:</strong> Immerse yourself in the game's energy with an incredible soundtrack that sets the tone for epic battles and intense moments. Soundtrack by legendary producers\u00a0<strong>Zach Degaetano</strong> &amp; <strong>Jordan Witzigreuter</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed with Love:</strong> From the creator of Bardbarian, Jumpjet Rex, Holoball, and Guano Gladiators</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to defend the island, trainer? 3,2,1, GO.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/971220?t=1770243734","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/971220?t=1770243734","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/971220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770243734","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/971220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770243734","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/971220/extras/a124cbd454b7e9a79117622a75382184.poster.avif?t=1770243734\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/971220/extras/a124cbd454b7e9a79117622a75382184.webm?t=1770243734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/971220/extras/a124cbd454b7e9a79117622a75382184.mp4?t=1770243734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Rogue Monster Rush!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an ever-evolving journey to defend your island base from hordes of invading robots in this challenging <strong>roguelike x tower defense x monster collecting</strong> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monstrous Tower Defense:</strong>\u00a0Hatch, Upgrade, Collect and command a variety of monster defenders, each with unique abilities, to fend off waves of relentless enemies. Assemble your ultimate party loadout and unleash havoc upon the invading forces. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Roguelike Gameplay:</strong> Every playthrough is a new adventure! Build your maps with randomly chosen tiles, discover powerful upgrades, and adapt your tactics to overcome increasingly challenging waves of foes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Depth:</strong> Master the art of monster placement, resource management, team composition, player abilities, leader skills, and upgrades to outsmart and overpower your adversaries.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active Gameplay:</strong> Engage in a dynamic and active playstyle where every moment counts. Unleash player abilities for clutch moments and enjoy more interactive and thrilling gameplay experiences than traditional tower defense. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incredible Soundtrack:</strong> Immerse yourself in the game's energy with an incredible soundtrack that sets the tone for epic battles and intense moments. Soundtrack by legendary producers\u00a0<strong>Zach Degaetano</strong> &amp; <strong>Jordan Witzigreuter</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed with Love:</strong> From the creator of Bardbarian, Jumpjet Rex, Holoball, and Guano Gladiators</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to defend the island, trainer? 3,2,1, GO.</strong></p>","developers":["Ghost Vibes LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/971220/header.jpg?t=1770243734","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/971220/927389074/b7e36b9e15279e449c5a21cb943742fd72463765/1751170400/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749319449","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/971220/927389074/b7e36b9e15279e449c5a21cb943742fd72463765/1751170400/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749319449","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/971220/927389074/b7e36b9e15279e449c5a21cb943742fd72463765/1751170400/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749319449","id":257152947,"name":"Gameplay Trailer 2 - Hatchery Update - June","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152947/071abb24cc00672bb356c74f7aa8ed10a5ff5be7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749319449"}],"name":"Rogue Monster Rush","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Rogue Monster Rush - $4.99 USD","packageid":318317,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":499}],"title":"Buy Rogue Monster Rush"}],"packages":[318317],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core Inte